msgid "Danger: with this enabled, uninstalling deletes price history, publications and settings. Without it, uninstall keeps the historical and audit data. The anchor prices and the 30-day lowest prices are the legal evidence and are kept either way; delete the wp_sidrena_price_history table by hand to remove them too. Never touches WooCommerce or WordPress data."
